{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49677","headline":"贺明朝 一 · 欧阳炯","name":"贺明朝 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔花间初识面，红袖半遮妆脸。\n轻转石榴帬带，故将纤纤玉指，偷捻双凤金线。\n碧梧桐锁深深院，谁料得两情，何日教缱绻？\n羡春来双燕，飞到玉楼，朝暮相见。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}